        "_uid": "c8482a5b-ca3c-b5e3-4b32-6b248fb29908",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The course is hosted on AKU's VLE and students attend weekly webinars or online lessons taught from Dar es Salaam, Tanzania. Course participants are also required to access input material including online resources and videos available on the course site, and upload video presentations on the platform.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "ELE_net plans to expand the provision of 'virtual' face-to-face teaching to other AKU programmes and campuses in 2019. ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
