    "show_share": true,
    "description": "ELE_net's new course  Academic Presentation Skills  is being offered to students in Nairobi, Kenya. This course aims at helping SONAM BScN students in their final year to prepare for the academic presentations they have to give for their electives. It does this by providing training in the language and skills needed for academic presentations and giving talks in professional contexts more generally.",
